        "fault"
      ]
    },
    "model": {
      "fields": [
        "model",
        "user",
        "more",
        "tokenCap",
        "sha256"
      ],
      "answer": [
        "status",
        "text",
        "late",
        "error",
        "sha256"
      ],
      "system": "harness/converge/policy.md of the plugin",
      "tokenCap": {
        "minimum": 1,
        "maximum": 8000
      },
      "more": {
        "maxItems": 2,
        "maxBytes": 65536,
        "roles": [
          "assistant",
          "user"
        ]
      },
      "note": "the engine asks a model call only within these bounds: a token cap within tokenCap, at most more.maxItems correction messages of more.maxBytes in all, a packet (the user message) of packet.maxBytes bytes at most, and asksPerCommand model asks of one command, its nested commands among them, a refused one counted. The ask names the model the Wave Plan's wave.model.converge names, or the --model of the command line; the client calls only where that model equals the person's own setting, mc17 config model on the computer, or the --model of the command line, and refuses any other, so a model the lock, a plan file or the engine names alone spends nothing",
      "packet": {
        "maxBytes": 262144
      },
      "asksPerCommand": 8
    },
    "run-test": {
      "fields": [
        "command",
        "decision"
      ],
      "answer": [
